             PGM
/*   SETS JCW-AREQJCW-259 TO ALLOW REQUISITIONS TO BE CUT     */
/*   WHEN THE WORK ORDER IS APPROVED                          */
             CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (259 1)) VALUE('1')
             CALL TAPPRVWO
             CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (259 1)) VALUE(' ')
             ENDPGM
